507
00:31:45.737 --> 00:31:47.655
<i>Musim semi sangat singkat.</i>

508
00:31:48.531 --> 00:31:50.199
<i>Segera setelah tiba,</i>

509
00:31:50.283 --> 00:31:52.869
<i>perayaan bunga</i>
